00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:32.890
Kanye West.

00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:34.480
And there are many people like that out there.

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:38.930
But he has a lot of people that follow him.

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:39.930
That's great.

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:42.880
A lot of people follow many different people
for different reasons.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:46.150
If that's your style, where you want to convince
people that you know what you're talking about

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:47.220
but you don't?

00:06:47.220 --> 00:06:48.220
That's a style.

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:49.340
I just don't recommend that style.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:50.340
#11:Sales

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:53.870
The next one is sales, somebody that's an
incredible salesman.

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:55.510
