00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:14.260
Because every day Warren Buffett lives 88
years, I need to drink eight cans of Coke

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:16.660
a day," and you would drink it because he's
a salesman.

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:19.320
He can't help himself, but sell.

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:21.270
Everywhere he goes, he sells.

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:27.780
Geico Cadillac, dealerships, furniture, he
