00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:33.990
#7: Seductive

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:35.110
The next is seductive.

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:36.920
Maybe you're the seductive type of speaker.

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:39.340
Maybe you speak and you seduce people.

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:41.660
Maybe you have your own charming, seductive
way.

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:44.320
