00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:46.820
They were some of the most seductive speakers
of all time.

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:50.730
Bill Clinton could give you a talk, look at
you and say something and you would say, "I

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:54.580
