00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:56.390
It's like you're being hypnotized.

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:57.910
You're seduced.

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:02.460
You're in a whole different land.

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:03.460
That's a seductive speaker.

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:04.460
