00:08:42.689 --> 00:08:44.710
It's just music, the way he does it.

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:47.040
It's just flowing when he does it.

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:48.040
And he moves you.

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:49.040
#15: Philosophical

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.370
And then there's philosophical, which could
