00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:53.089
That could be Phil Jackson.

00:08:53.089 --> 00:08:54.750
He makes you question things.

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:57.100
You'll talk to Phil Jackson and he'll make
you question things.

00:08:57.100 --> 00:08:59.889
People say, "Hey Phil, why did you do.

00:08:59.889 --> 00:09:04.640
. . " and he says, "Why do you think I did
. . . " And why do you think such and such

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:05.740
