00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:27.069
. . every one of them you study so you're
philosophical.

00:09:27.069 --> 00:09:28.529
You like to question things.

00:09:28.529 --> 00:09:29.529
Great.

00:09:29.529 --> 00:09:30.529
That's your style.

00:09:30.529 --> 00:09:31.529
