00:10:07.389 --> 00:10:08.600
He's done a fantastic job.

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:09.830
Probably one of the best GMs.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:13.350
If it wasn't for him LeBron James probably
wouldn't have gone to Miami.

00:10:13.350 --> 00:10:15.269
So, that's his style.

00:10:15.269 --> 00:10:20.220
By the way, just so you know, many of you
admire at least two or three of the people

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.490
