00:10:34.259 --> 00:10:35.899
Steve Jobs is my favorite!

00:10:35.899 --> 00:10:36.950
Mine is Barack Obama.

00:10:36.950 --> 00:10:38.029
But it's going to be different.

00:10:38.029 --> 00:10:39.029
It doesn't matter.

00:10:39.029 --> 00:10:41.290
It's your voice.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:42.829
What's your voice?

00:10:42.829 --> 00:10:45.910
Find your voice, and don't try to be anybody
